# Browser-automation scratch. The Playwright MCP server writes screenshots,
# page snapshots and console logs into its working directory, which is the
# repo root. One of those console logs reached 167 MB and was committed by
# accident, making the branch unpushable (GitHub rejects blobs over 100 MB).
